# Deterministic Git blob hashes for the source-only Windows patch updater.
# Windows packaging must not silently convert JS/CSS/HTML into CRLF after
# GitHub assigns the commit's blob SHA. PowerShell and C# are compiled/used
# independently and never included in the source-only patch.
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.map text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
